"STOCK MARKET TRADING INSTITUTE\r\nComprehensive Curriculum & Program Syllabus\r\n1. Technical Analysis Essentials (Beginner)\r\nFee:  ₹7,000/-\r\nTarget Audience: Absolute beginners and early-stage traders looking to build a rock-solid foundation across financial markets.\r\nDesigned to take you from total novice to confident chart reader, this course demystifies market mechanics, chart structures, and essential execution rules.\r\nWhat You Will Master:\r\n•\tMarket Structure & Instruments: Understanding equities, indices, and asset classes available for trading.\r\n•\tIPO & Equity Fundamentals: How stocks and shares are issued to the public and traded in the secondary market.\r\n•\tSupport & Resistance Dynamics: How key levels drive price movement and reveal market strength.\r\n•\tCandlestick Mechanics: Decoding raw price action, bar anatomy, and forecasting future momentum.\r\n•\tChart Patterns: Identifying classic high-probability chart formations and structural setups.\r\n•\tBeginner Execution Strategies: Simple, repeatable trading setups designed to build consistency early in your trading journey.\r\n\r\n2. Advanced Technical Analysis & Market Mastery\r\nFee:  ₹7,000/-\r\nTarget Audience: Intermediate traders wanting to master indicator suites, Smart Money Concepts (SMC), Derivatives, and Swing Trading.\r\nA comprehensive deep dive into institutional supply and demand, option Greeks, order flow mechanics, and professional risk psychology.\r\nModule 1: Advanced Charting & Pattern Dynamics\r\n•\tPattern Dynamics: Continuation vs. Reversal setups combined with structural key levels.\r\n•\tInstitutional Zones: Demand and Supply Zone identification for precise entries.\r\nModule 2: Professional Indicator Suite & Volume Analytics\r\n•\tMomentum & Trend: RSI, ADX, MACD analysis for trend confirmation.\r\n•\tVolume Dynamics: Standard Volume & Fixed Range Volume Profile (FRVP).\r\n•\tDynamic Levels: Pivot Points and multi-level Fibonacci Retracements.\r\n•\tMoving Averages: EMA/SMA support, resistance, and crossover execution patterns.\r\nModule 3: Futures & Options (FnO) Mastery\r\n•\tDerivatives Basics: Mechanics of underlying assets vs. derivative contracts.\r\n•\tOption Buying: Strategies engineered for momentum and small retail accounts.\r\n•\tOption Selling: Harvesting theta decay systematically.\r\n•\tFutures Trading: Understanding leverage and high-volume institutional positioning.\r\n•\tOptions Greeks & OI: Managing volatility, delta, and sentiment tracking via Open Interest.\r\nModule 4: Smart Money Concepts (SMC) & Trap Trading\r\n•\tStructure Mapping: Higher Highs/Lows and Lower Highs/Lows.\r\n•\tInstitutional Footprints: Change of Character (CHOCH), Order Blocks, and Fair Value Gaps (FVG / Advanced FVG).\r\n•\tLiquidity Dynamics: Inducement, identifying liquidity pools, and turning retail traps into high-probability entries.\r\nModule 5: Swing Trading - The Wealth Creation Engine\r\n•\tStock Screening: Screening high-momentum growth and B-Grade breakout stocks.\r\n•\tPrecision Timing: Setups for optimal risk-reward entries and exits.\r\nModule 6: Trading Psychology & Capital Management\r\n•\tTrader Mindset: Behavioral discipline and psychological mastery.\r\n•\tMoney & Risk Rules: Risk-per-trade rules, position sizing, and managing drawdown phases.\r\n\r\n3. Global Markets & Forex Mastery\r\nFee:  ₹11,000/-\r\nTarget Audience: Traders aiming to access round-the-clock global financial, forex, and commodity markets.\r\nLearn how to navigate high-volatility global markets using macro liquidity models, news events, and institutional order flow.\r\nWhat You Will Master:\r\n•\tGlobal Foundations: Market sessions, liquidity cycles, and forex instrument pairings.\r\n•\tRisk Control & Lot Sizing: Position sizing formulas designed specifically for forex and commodity leverage.\r\n•\tCore Technicals: Candlestick analysis, structural patterns, and dynamic support/resistance.\r\n•\tAdvanced Global Setups: Mid-week rejection setups, Fibonacci confluence, and session open/close liquidity runs.\r\n•\tNews Trading Mechanics: How to interpret economic calendars and safely trade high-impact macroeconomic news releases.\r\n•\tInstitutional SMC & Traps: Smart Money Concepts, inducement mechanics, and trap trading across international assets.\r\n•\tGlobal Psychology: Handling leverage-induced stress, drawdown control, and capital discipline.\r\n\r\n4. Fundamental Analysis & Value Investing\r\nFee:  Included in Comprehensive Path\r\nTarget Audience: Investors and long-term traders building fundamental screening skills for wealth compounding.\r\nA step-by-step framework to evaluate business health, balance sheet strength, and true intrinsic value.\r\nWhat You Will Master:\r\n•\tBusiness & Sector Evaluation: Analyzing business models, industry drivers, and sector-to-stock relative strength.\r\n•\tFinancial Statement Analysis: Deep dive into Income Statements (P&L), Balance Sheets, and Cash Flow Statements.\r\n•\tMetric & Ratio Analysis: Profitability, debt, valuation, and operational efficiency ratios.\r\n•\tStructure Analysis: Evaluating Standalone vs. Consolidated financial statements.\r\n•\tValuation Frameworks: Spotting overvalued traps and unearthing undervalued growth stocks.\r\n\r\nProgram Comparison Summary\r\nProgram Name\tFee\tTarget Audience\tKey Core Focus\r\nTechnical Analysis Essentials\t₹7,000\tBeginners & Novices\tBasics, Support/Resistance, Candlesticks, Patterns\r\nAdvanced Technical Mastery\t₹7,000\tIntermediate Traders\tIndicators, FnO, Option Greeks, SMC, Swing Trading\r\nGlobal Markets & Forex\t₹11,000\tAdvanced / Global Traders\tForex Instruments, News Trading, Lot Sizing, SMC\r\nFundamental Analysis\tContact Us\tLong-term Investors\tP&L, Ratio Analysis, Valuations, Cash Flow\r\n\r\n"
